  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAdams County, IA - County Government\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n\n Courts\n\n Employment\n FAQ\n Public Notices\n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n Home\n \n\n About \n \n\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n Historic Preservation Commission\n School Districts\n Township Information\n \n \n \n\n Departments \n \n\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Conservation\n Emergency Management\n Engineer\n Environmental Health\n Recorder\n Sheriff\n Treasurer\n Veteran's Affairs\n Weed Commissioner\n Zoning\n \n \n \n\n Supervisors \n \n\n Boards & Commissions\n County Ordinances\n Meetings & Minutes\n \n \n Contact\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Courts\n Employment\n FAQ\n Public Notices\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n Clear · 45°\n \n \n\n Find departments, services, staff, and more\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n Adams County Courthouse\n \n\n \n\n \n\nWelcome toAdams County, Iowa\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n Elections \n \n \n\n \n \n GIS Mapping \n \n \n\n \n \n Pay Property Taxes \n \n \n\n \n \n Renew Vehicle Tags \n \n \n\n \n \n Supervisors Meetings & Agendas \n \n \n\n \n \n Passports \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \nAdams County was established in 1851. It's home to four communities, Southwest Valley Schools, and around 4,000 residents. The County is administered by a five-member Board of Supervisors who are elected for four-year terms. Other elected officials include the Attorney, Auditor, Recorder, Sheriff, and Treasurer. \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n \nWhat's Happening\n \n\n \n\n \n\n Oct \n \n\n 19 \n \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 500 Ninth Street · Corning, IA \n Agenda \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 500 Ninth Street\n Corning, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 19, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Adams County Board of Supervisors meets every Monday morning, except for holidays, at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Room in the Adams County Courthouse. \n \n\nIf you have an item to be placed on the Agenda, please reach out to the Auditor's Office at 641-322-3340. Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n Oct \n \n\n 26 \n \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 500 Ninth Street · Corning, IA \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 500 Ninth Street\n Corning, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 26, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Adams County Board of Supervisors meets every Monday morning, except for holidays, at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Room in the Adams County Courthouse. \n \n\nIf you have an item to be placed on the Agenda, please reach out to the Auditor's Office at 641-322-3340. Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n Nov \n \n\n 2 \n \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 500 Ninth Street · Corning, IA \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 500 Ninth Street\n Corning, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n November 2, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Adams County Board of Supervisors meets every Monday morning, except for holidays, at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Room in the Adams County Courthouse. \n \n\nIf you have an item to be placed on the Agenda, please reach out to the Auditor's Office at 641-322-3340. Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n Nov \n \n\n 3 \n \n \n\n Election Day\n \n \n\n \nElection Day\n Corning, IA\n \n\n November 3, 2026 \n\n \n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n Nov \n \n\n 10 \n \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 500 Ninth Street · Corning, IA \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 500 Ninth Street\n Corning, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n November 10, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Adams County Board of Supervisors meets every Monday morning, except for holidays, at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Room in the Adams County Courthouse. \n \n\nIf you have an item to be placed on the Agenda, please reach out to the Auditor's Office at 641-322-3340. Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n Nov \n \n\n 16 \n \n \n\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 9:00 am\n 500 Ninth Street · Corning, IA \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n 500 Ninth Street\n Corning, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n November 16, 2026 \n 9:00 am \n\nThe Adams County Board of Supervisors meets every Monday morning, except for holidays, at 9:00 a.m. in the Board Room in the Adams County Courthouse. \n \n\nIf you have an item to be placed on the Agenda, please reach out to the Auditor's Office at 641-322-3340. Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n View the Full Calendar\n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n \nNews & Announcements\n\n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n Friends of ISAC Award\n \nposted 8/20/26\n \n \nRead More \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n Caregiver Support Group\n \nposted 4/28/26\n \n \nRead More \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n Recycling\n \nposted 1/26/26\n \n \nRead More \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n Welcome & Respect Our Amish Neighbors\n \nposted 7/9/25\n \n \nRead More \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n Your LIfe Iowa Find Help Near You Locator\n \nposted 7/3/25\n \n \nRead More \n \n \n \n \n \n\n\n News Employment Bid Notices Sign Up for Notifications\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \nAdams County, Iowa\n\n 500 Ninth St.\n\n Corning, Iowa 50841\n\n Contact Us\n \nCourthouse Hours\n\n Monday - Friday\n\n 8:30 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\n\n Closed Holidays\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Adams County, Iowa | \n\n Translate Language\n \n Translate | Employee Resources\n \n \n \npowered by \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeterans' Day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving (November 26, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving Observed (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Eve (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas Day (December 25, 2026)\n \nNew Year's Eve (December 31, 2026)\n \nNew Year's Day (January 1, 2027)\n \n\n\n\n\n\n"
